+
+## `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board. Only board administrators can publish a board. Once published, the board is available at its secret public URL, returned as `public_url` in board JSON responses.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`. The `public_url` field contains the secret URL.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. Only board administrators can unpublish a board. The secret public URL stops working immediately.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
